- `getTimeout()` / `setTimeout()`
- `getDatasource()` / `setDatasource()`
- `getAuthorizationHeader()` (computed from `accessToken`)
- `getMiddleware()` - returns MiddlewareManager
- `addRequestInterceptor()` / `addResponseInterceptor()`

